# Franko sources are UTF-8 text whose string literals may span raw
# newlines (programs/string.fr, tests/success/string_escapes). A CRLF
# checkout would inject \r bytes into the decoded string data, which
# changes byte counts and breaks those programs/tests. Force LF for
# every .fr file on every platform; this takes precedence over
# core.autocrlf.
*.fr text eol=lf
